{"notice":"Tanzil Quran Text, Copyright (C) 2007-2021 Tanzil Project, License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0. Permission is granted to copy and distribute verbatim copies of this text, but changing it is not allowed. This Quran text can be used in any website or application, provided that its source (Tanzil Project) is clearly indicated, and a link is made to tanzil.net to enable users to keep track of changes. Please check updates at: http://tanzil.net/updates/ Word meanings and transliteration: Layout and word data from the Quranic Universal Library (https://qul.tarteel.ai), by Tarteel.","ayat":[[["وَٱلشَّمْسِ","By the sun","wal-shamsi"],["وَضُحَىٰهَا","and its brightness","waḍuḥāhā"]],[["وَٱلْقَمَرِ","And the moon","wal-qamari"],["إِذَا","when","idhā"],["تَلَىٰهَا","it follows it","talāhā"]],[["وَٱلنَّهَارِ","And the day","wal-nahāri"],["إِذَا","when","idhā"],["جَلَّىٰهَا","it displays it","jallāhā"]],[["وَٱلَّيْلِ","And the night","wa-al-layli"],["إِذَا","when","idhā"],["يَغْشَىٰهَا","it covers it","yaghshāhā"]],[["وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","And the heaven","wal-samāi"],["وَمَا","and (He) Who","wamā"],["بَنَىٰهَا","constructed it","banāhā"]],[["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","And the earth","wal-arḍi"],["وَمَا","and by (He) Who","wamā"],["طَحَىٰهَا","spread it","ṭaḥāhā"]],[["وَنَفْسٍ","And (the) soul","wanafsin"],["وَمَا","and (He) Who","wamā"],["سَوَّىٰهَا","proportioned it","sawwāhā"]],[["فَأَلْهَمَهَا","And He inspired it","fa-alhamahā"],["فُجُورَهَا","(to distinguish) its wickedness","fujūrahā"],["وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","and its righteousness","wataqwāhā"]],[["قَدْ","Indeed","qad"],["أَفْلَحَ","he succeeds","aflaḥa"],["مَن","who","man"],["زَكَّىٰهَا","purifies it","zakkāhā"]],[["وَقَدْ","And indeed","waqad"],["خَابَ","he fails","khāba"],["مَن","who","man"],["دَسَّىٰهَا","buries it","dassāhā"]],[["كَذَّبَتْ","Denied","kadhabat"],["ثَمُودُ","Thamud","thamūdu"],["بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","by their transgression","biṭaghwāhā"]],[["إِذِ","When","idhi"],["ٱنۢبَعَثَ","(was) sent forth","inbaʿatha"],["أَشْقَىٰهَا","(the) most wicked of them","ashqāhā"]],[["فَقَالَ","But said","faqāla"],["لَهُمْ","to them","lahum"],["رَسُولُ","(the) Messenger","rasūlu"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi"],["نَاقَةَ","(It is the) she-camel","nāqata"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi"],["وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","and her drink","wasuq'yāhā"]],[["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","But they denied him","fakadhabūhu"],["فَعَقَرُوهَا","and they hamstrung her","faʿaqarūhā"],["فَدَمْدَمَ","So destroyed","fadamdama"],["عَلَيْهِمْ","them","ʿalayhim"],["رَبُّهُم","their Lord","rabbuhum"],["بِذَنۢبِهِمْ","for their sin","bidhanbihim"],["فَسَوَّىٰهَا","and leveled them","fasawwāhā"]],[["وَلَا","And not","walā"],["يَخَافُ","He fears","yakhāfu"],["عُقْبَـٰهَا","its consequences","ʿuq'bāhā"]]]}